<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Qantas says to cut by A$100 mln more.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Qantas says to cut by A$100 mln more.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qantas Airways Ltd said on Wednesday it expected to increase its cost cutting programme by about A$100 million for the year to June 30, 1997 on top of the previously announced target of A$330 million.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect it to increase by about A$100 million,&quot; chairman Gary Pemberton said after the annual meeting when asked about how much the airline would increase its cost cutting programme.</p>
</text>
